  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training and Upskilling Regenerative Contract Farming</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stable Foods solves food insecurity while creating meaningful valuable rural economic opportunities.  There are 5m+ smallholder farmers in Kenya alone, and the majority of them are subsistence farmers whose production is so low that are unable to support themselves, nor contribute to the growing food needs of the country.  Stable Foods solves this problem by offering an innovative and ultra-affordable drip irrigation subscription program, which de-risks one of the major impediments to transitioning from a subsistence farmer to a commercial one and is affordable to almost every smallholder in Kenya.  Additionally, Stable Foods layer on complimentary training, input sales and a guaranteed market access program so that theywe are an end &#x2013; end solution for smallholders that want to transform themselves into serious food producers.</narrative>
  </description>
